{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫花旦陳瀅演技精湛，加上性格爽朗，深得網觀眾歡心，不過她在台慶劇《璀璨之城》中的大膽演出，穿上黑色透視內衣色誘張智霖，在鏡頭施展「全裸誘惑」的一幕，再加上「腿張開」任影，意識大膽挑戰電視尺度極限，事後卻惹來不少網民狂轟劇情過於三級！</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:06.824271+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T03:19:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.799129+00:00","content_hash":"42e63615efd450f64a3527e2dd46be838e22b0d4bfa2c842a080584892929ba6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}